## Problem Definition
In the world of sports, predicting if a team is going to win or lose is the million dollar question.
With the power of artificial intelligence, it is possible to make a very solid prediction that can sway the odds in your favour.
Vast amounts of data on nba matches exists in which we can process for meaningful trends and outcomes.
Various developments on optimal machine learning algorithms are explored every day, and with this project it is possible to find out which one performs best.
Once developed, this model can be deployed as an API or website for others to take advantage of.